<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix A </span>Appendix</h2>

<section id="A1.SS1" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">A.1 </span>Detail Experimental Settings</h3>

<div id="A1.SS1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.SS1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">We present the settings used in the training GA-DMS in Tab. <a href="#A1.T5" title="Table 5 ‣ A.1 Detail Experimental Settings ‣ Appendix A Appendix ‣ Gradient-Attention Guided Dual-Masking Synergetic Framework for Robust Text-based Person Retrieval" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">5</span></a>.</p>
</div>
